{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/2","id":4851298010,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUZxf888AAAABISju2g","html_url":"https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pull/2","diff_url":"https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pull/2.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pull/2.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/issues/2","number":2,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(updates): 核验精确版本更新说明并独立重试","user":{"login":"gzers","id":22311504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzExNTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22311504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers","html_url":"https://github.com/gzers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"面板详情以前固定显示缺省说明，管理器网页由版本直接拼出。现在两个入口共用精确候选的说明组件：面板先核对同版本npm元数据与维护仓库，再读取匹配的非草稿Release；管理器优先updater正文，只有核验过的Release才提供网页。说明有加载、可读、缺失、独立失败重试；失败不改版本检查、备份或安装结果。\n\n按活动根/对象/通道/版本缓存，命中不联网；总截止30s、响应256KiB/正文64KiB、默认TLS与既有代理策略，拒绝重定向和来源错配。关闭观察者、切候选/通道/根及重试控件移除时保留结果归属与焦点。\n\n缓存还校验状态、正文、来源及发布时间一致。HTTP客户端仅真实缓存未命中时在线程池惰性初始化并在事务内复用，有效离线缓存不因代理配置错误而失败。\n\n依赖草稿PR#1，base为feature/0.1.10-update-center-focus@be7395a，head为d3b83b3822bf10a511556d80dc851c2ccfb17cf5；未合入main。\n\n验证：旧be说明flow黑盒3项断言失败、新630通过；630前端97文件/501通过、Rust34组/884通过/6忽略，fmt/strictClippy/类型构建通过。缓存补丁同字节旧630为12通过/4失败，新d3为16/16；d3完整Rust34组/888通过/6忽略、fmt/strictClippy/diff通过。前端未改，旧501结果只归630轮次；新同SHA CI负责完整集成。业务红、首轮失败及完整日志归docs/governance-main@6bc471fb的IMP-20与协作包证据。\n\n630的pushCI38490716335、PRCI38491351619及候选38492240481均success，旧安装包与回执身份独立核验，但只证明630。新d3 pushCI38495887680/PRCI38495891289仍在运行，新候选尚未生成；不以旧制品证明缓存修复通过。\n\n保持草稿：新SHA双平台原生/长正文/网页/独立重试/缓存真实计数，标题栏真实还原、安装数据保留、完整更新/备份/事件、真实周期及官方0.1.9同机配对均待验；macOS原CPU/RSS失败不解除。全程单隔离原生实例，协调旧实例结束并确认0后才可切候选，不自动替换日常版或真实数据，不执行未许可FZ50脚本，不合并、签名、发布或晋升通道。\n","created_at":"2026-10-14T00:38:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:34:13Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"147135231ba24ccb89a0d1c43e6ed969ba490e09","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/2/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/2/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/issues/2/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/statuses/d3b83b3822bf10a511556d80dc851c2ccfb17cf5","head":{"label":"gzers:feature/0.1.10-release-details","ref":"feature/0.1.10-release-details","sha":"d3b83b3822bf10a511556d80dc851c2ccfb17cf5","user":{"login":"gzers","id":22311504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzExNTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22311504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers","html_url":"https://github.com/gzers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/orgs","repos_url":"https:/